Z||000003||FieroLT1||11-06-2001||07:19 AM||||A mechanic might, thats, MIGHT, get it right the first time around. Otherwise you'll be comming back to get things redone.<BR>At Archie's will be done right the first time around + he'll stand behind his work.<BR>Not to mention he has done 100's of them already.<P>------------------<BR>Winston Ojeda<BR><B>88 Formula LT1</B><BR>Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA<BR><A HREF="http://www.FieroLT1.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.FieroLT1.com</A><BR><I>Home of the Fiero LT1</I><BR>  <A HREF="mailto:wojeda@FieroLT1.com">wojeda@FieroLT1.com</A> ||||reg||1
